> Having a low experience level has two main advantages:
>
>  * Easier monsters will be generated.
>  * It costs much less to donate money to priests for divine protection.
>
> Gaining experience levels has these advantages:
>
>  * More HP.
>  * More Pw.
>  * More skill slots.
>  * Improved spell failure rates.
>  * For some classes, more intrinsics. (Valks get speed, monks get PR,
>    &c. &c.)

* +XL to-hit in combat
* Affects the power of most attack spells fairly significantly

